{"content_hash": "774dff5462adbe1e", "version_id": 641, "article_id": 65, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Michael Jordan's 1998 jersey sells for £10.6m", "title_zh": "迈克尔·乔丹1998年的球衣卖到1060万英镑", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/basketball/articles/cje36qz977yqo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1641919868936-bc8702cb887e?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NXx8am9yZGFuJTIwbGFzdCUyMGRhbmNlfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE4NTkxNTN8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Keith Christian Armada on Unsplash", "author": "Keith Christian Armada", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@armada_kc?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-pair-of-red-and-black-sneakers-with-flames-in-the-background-v2hJG3bD-sY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(176, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(214, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "15c81305d86b"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-13", "word_count": 89, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "Michael Jordan's basketball jersey from 1998 sold for a lot of money. It cost £10.6m. That is a new record.", "lead_zh": "迈克尔·乔丹1998年的一件篮球球衣卖了很多钱，成交价1060万英镑，创下新纪录。", "preview": "Jordan wore the jersey in the 1998 NBA Finals. He scored 37 points in that game. He also signed the jersey.", "preview_zh": "乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛中穿了这件球衣。那场比赛他得了37分，还在球衣上签了名。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 629, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/65/en_a1.wav", "duration": 34.675, "size_bytes": 1669244, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/65/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 35.75, "size_bytes": 215424, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/65/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/65/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 38.6, "size_bytes": 232560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/65/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/65/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 33.425, "size_bytes": 201456, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/65/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/65/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 35.65, "size_bytes": 214848, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/65/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fa8dd94/content/data/versions/641.json", "paragraphs": ["Jordan wore the jersey in the 1998 NBA Finals. He scored 37 points in that game. He also signed the jersey.", "He won his sixth NBA championship that year. He then stopped playing for the Chicago Bulls. He was the best player in all six finals.", "Only one sports item costs more. Babe Ruth's baseball jersey sold for £18.2m in 2024. A rich man in Miami bought Jordan's jersey.", "The old record for a Jordan jersey was £9.3m. It was set two weeks ago. That jersey was not signed."], "paragraphs_zh": ["乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛中穿了这件球衣。那场比赛他得了37分，还在球衣上签了名。", "那一年他赢得第六个NBA总冠军，之后不再为芝加哥公牛队打球。六次总决赛他都是最佳球员。", "只有一件体育物品比它更贵。贝比·鲁斯的棒球球衣在2024年卖了1820万英镑。迈阿密一位有钱人买下了乔丹的球衣。", "乔丹球衣的旧纪录是930万英镑，两周前刚创下。那件球衣没有签名。"], "body": "Jordan wore the jersey in the 1998 NBA Finals. He scored 37 points in that game. He also signed the jersey.\n\nHe won his sixth NBA championship that year. He then stopped playing for the Chicago Bulls. He was the best player in all six finals.\n\nOnly one sports item costs more. Babe Ruth's baseball jersey sold for £18.2m in 2024. A rich man in Miami bought Jordan's jersey.\n\nThe old record for a Jordan jersey was £9.3m. It was set two weeks ago. That jersey was not signed.", "body_zh": "乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛中穿了这件球衣。那场比赛他得了37分，还在球衣上签了名。\n\n那一年他赢得第六个NBA总冠军，之后不再为芝加哥公牛队打球。六次总决赛他都是最佳球员。\n\n只有一件体育物品比它更贵。贝比·鲁斯的棒球球衣在2024年卖了1820万英镑。迈阿密一位有钱人买下了乔丹的球衣。\n\n乔丹球衣的旧纪录是930万英镑，两周前刚创下。那件球衣没有签名。", "text": "Jordan wore the jersey in the 1998 NBA Finals. He scored 37 points in that game. He also signed the jersey. He won his sixth NBA championship that year. He then stopped playing for the Chicago Bulls. He was the best player in all six finals. Only one sports item costs more. Babe Ruth's baseball jersey sold for £18.2m in 2024. A rich man in Miami bought Jordan's jersey. The old record for a Jordan jersey was £9.3m. It was set two weeks ago. That jersey was not signed.", "vocab": [{"word": "jersey", "pos": "noun", "zh": "球衣", "note": "运动员穿的队服", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sell", "pos": "verb", "zh": "卖", "note": "过去式是 sold", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "record", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "最好的成绩", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "签名", "note": "在东西上写自己的名字", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "point", "pos": "noun", "zh": "得分", "note": "比赛中的分数", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "championship", "pos": "noun", "zh": "冠军", "note": "比赛的第一名", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "buy", "pos": "verb", "zh": "买", "note": "过去式是 bought", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rich", "pos": "adj", "zh": "有钱的", "note": "有很多钱", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m", "summary_original": "A Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season sells for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.", "body_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m\nBy\nBen Collins\nBBC Sport journalist\nPublished\n5 hours ago\nA Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season has sold for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.\nJordan wore the Chicago Bulls jersey during game two of the 1998 NBA Finals and has autographed it too.\nHe scored a game-high 37 points that evening before ending his last season with the Bulls with a 4-2 series win for his sixth and final NBA Championship. He was named the Finals' Most Valuable Player in all six.\nThe only item of sports memorabilia that has cost more is the jersey worn by baseball legend Babe Ruth when he \"called the shot\" during the 1932 World Series, which was sold for $24.1m (£18.2m) in 2024.\nThe previous high for a basketball item was a card featuring Jordan and Kobe Bryant from 2007-08 which\nsold for $12.9m (£9.8m) last year.\nThe previous record for a piece of game-worn Jordan memorabilia was set just two weeks ago when his jersey from game three of the 1998 Finals, which is not autographed,\nsold via auction for $12.3m (£9.3m).\nThe latest purchase was made by Miami real estate investor Ron Firman in a private sale through Hunt Auctions.\nDavid Hunt, president of Hunt Auctions, said in a statement: \"While Michael Jordan's importance within the sports memorabilia marketplace has long been established, it has now escalated to an elite asset class more typically reserved for iconic works of art.\"\nRelated topics\nBasketball\nMore on this story\nWhy everyone’s talking about The Last Dance\nPublished\n12 May 2020\nMaradona's 'Hand of God' shirt sells for £7.1m\nPublished\n4 May 2022", "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T02:39:12.219452", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Jordan", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.675, "sm": 300, "em": 675, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "wore",